{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen-1788457721-ftFc7w4CVeSNnK97y3Zh","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed: `Module.__call__` just forwards kwargs. So config params like temperature come either from `Predict(..., temperature=...)` (stored in self.config) or `program(..., config={\"temperature\": ...})`.\n\nFix my test: use `program(question=..., prediction=..., config={\"temperature\": 0.5})`. That tests co-existence with other config — matching the user's requirement \"work alongside all existing DSPy functionality like temperature adjustments\".\n\nAnd for the async test, override `acall` in PredictionSpyLM (delegating to `__call__`-like recording) so no real network call happens. Let me update the spy class:\n\n```python\nclass PredictionSpyLM(dspy.LM):\n    def __init__(self, *args, **kwargs):\n        super().__init__(*args, **kwargs)\n        self.calls = []\n\n    def __call__(self, prompt=None, messages=None, **kwargs):\n        self.calls.append({\"prompt\": prompt, \"messages\": messages, \"kwargs\": kwargs})\n        return [\"[[ ## answer ## ]]\\n100%!\"]\n\n    async def acall(self, prompt=None, messages=None, **kwargs):\n        return self.__call__(prompt=prompt, messages=messages, **kwargs)\n```\n\nHmm, but `BaseLM.acall` is decorated with `@with_callbacks`; overriding is fine. Actually simpler: override `aforward` and let `BaseLM.acall` handle it? `BaseLM.acall` calls `self.aforward(...)` then `self._process_lm_response(response, ...)` which expects an OpenAI-format response object with `.choices` etc. My `__call__` returns a list of strings, so `_process_lm_response` would break. So override `acall` directly to return the same list. Good.\n\nWait, but does `adapter.acall` call `lm.acall(...)`? Yes: `outputs = await lm.acall(messages=inputs, **lm_kwargs)`.\n\nLet me update the tests.","signature":""}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"Z.AI","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"daf4bd95-90eb-4bd5-a8b2-615c44312155","uuid":"eef6d929-ffe6-4f5f-907b-0a575846faa1","timestamp":"2026-09-03T17:48:54.825Z","request_id":"gen-1788457721-ftFc7w4CVeSNnK97y3Zh"}
